# RaidBossType2 (25286, Anakim), level 1 like the level 1 character, sees the character cast
# Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it: on a draw of 0 in 150 it wants its ranged DD
# magic (RANGE_DD_MAGIC_A, 4077) on the character at 1000000. RaidBossStandard's see-spell
# hook then finds no top desire target. The party hooks of RaidBossParty and RaidBossType2
# (privates, the hit rules, the jump, the peace zone and the respawns) are in
# tests/ai/raid_boss5_test.go: the format places no template privates.
character Hunter 1
skill 4694 1
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossParty
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossType2
npc boss 25286 RaidBoss 250 0 0 skill RANGE_DD_MAGIC_A 4077 8
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires boss cast(player,4077,move)=1000000
